---
# Slice roles are named as slice specs and /capabilities name them: grayspace-host, edge-nat, ghosts-client. Hyphens are valid Ansible role names.
skip_list:
  - role-name
  # Warns on every play with strategy: free, which main.yml's router and CA plays use; none of
  # them uses run_once (which free doesn't honour). Inline noqa doesn't reliably reach play-level rules.
  - run-once[play]
